# Enforce deterministic line endings. The HPC job scripts (*.sh, *.pbs, *.def)
# are executed as-is on Linux compute nodes where CRLF breaks /bin/bash parsing,
# and the test suite strictly asserts LF-only bytes on them. Force LF so a
# Windows checkout/commit can never silently CRLF them.
*.sh  text eol=lf
*.pbs text eol=lf
*.def text eol=lf

# Python source: LF everywhere (consistent with the rest of the project).
*.py  text eol=lf

# PowerShell is Windows-native: keep CRLF for editor friendliness.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
